{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791799680, "covers_from": "2026-10-12T10:08:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-12T10:09:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791799740, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-12T10:08:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 62388, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "長照", "content": "如何讓70歲以上的長輩能即時解決他們的資訊問題？會有像運動小巴這樣構想的資訊小巴進到社區嗎？", "display_name": "大安代表 李昀蓁", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T10:08:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 62389, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "其他", "content": "我是個不會手語的聽障，整個生活從聽課、聊天，到出社會工作聆聽會議、聽主管交代事項，都有困難，怎麼改善", "display_name": "文山代表 No.62,389", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T10:08:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "queue_number": 62390, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "內湖路二段，人行步道狹窄，還有電線桿阻礙，造成長者和婦幼推車行走困難。", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.62,390", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T10:08:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16285, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "騎樓地板在下雨天很滑（尤其是斜坡處），希望能有方法改善", "display_name": "南港代表 No.16,285", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T10:08:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 10, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 10195, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "內湖塞掉一個人的人生了，市長你有辦法嗎？", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.10,195", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 62389, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.62,389", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 62390, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.62,390", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number":